m/v/t64.5771-25/38982619_709619540446958_1947670398060919437_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nPP_GGLEDTgQ7kNvwEfpr97&_nc_oc=AdosVJs8w0rYZPX7xQrLV4YCrmabXBhuVcBV3fBVPJ-ILATygkbR6i9_uJXUBLtaDG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afymp_0ChFuXCXHe3ZyFYhDfQ62DBNZZPku9qrm13VViXQ&oe=69CBB90E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Trailer_crazy_cook_32bit.png", "id": "1038189767039681", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_1038189780373013_631460889995462255_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ef2sl1pk8bQQ7kNvwEj7ND7&_nc_oc=AdphzLNr_CaOMCq4-PKwIVP-ei5ZAU_q1FyigubRY-QsJ87fGWL7yKYXcljo3SRcWLo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyRRc1kWZUf4j7RDuE7OhkegZq-jPqdvS7ipCnuuWICcQ&oe=69CBB0C3"}, "display_name": "Crazy Cook", "keywords": ["cooking", "party", "family", "crazy", "cook"], "long_description": "Crazy Cook\u00ae is a fun and crazy cooking game in VR for the whole family !\nYour goal is to create great recipes\u2026with a twist : the ingredients are a bit hostile !\nSlice a chickenosaurus, peel a smiling onion, avoid a killer tomato, smash a garlic grenade with a hammer or pepper spray (literally) a flying punk pig : that's part of your job as a master chef.\nAre you ready to slice with a knife (workshop 1), peel or block with a peeler (workshop 2), smash with a hammer (workshop 3), season or shoot with a one-of-a-kind salt mill (workshop 4) or avoid monsterish ingredients coming from a canon with your wild kitchen tools to score the top of the charts ?\n10 recipes, with 4 workshops each, are included : that's 40 ways to have crazy fun ! \nFor now it's a solo game but we are working on making it a multiplayer game. \nIt's only the beginning ! We will regularly add new features, music, recipes, new tools and new workshops. \nThank you for purchasing the game. It means the world !", "short_description": "Crazy Cook\u00ae 